#### 2.3.11 uploadFile_onFileChange 文件变化时的回调，可用来修改文件名等信息，暂时不支持异步async
```javascript
this.uploadFile_onFileChange = ({_rootThis, _this, fileList}) => {  
fileList = fileList.map(file => {  
return {  
...file, name: 'test',  
originFileObj: {  
...file.originFileObj, name: 'test'  
}  
}  
}))
return fileList }
```

